sed.","react-hooks/exhaustive-deps","React Hook useCallback does nothing when called with only one argument. Did you forget to pass an array of dependencies?","'handleFilterClick' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleMouseEnter' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleMouseLeave' is assigned a value but never used.","'hoveredFilter' is assigned a value but never used.","'FontAwesomeIcon' is defined but never used.","'faArrowsRotate' is defined but never used.","'nextMonthsIndexes' is assigned a value but never used.","'daysArray' is assigned a value but never used.","'emptyDays' is assigned a value but never used.",{"range":"318","text":"317"},"jsx-a11y/anchor-is-valid","The href attribute requires a valid value to be accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide a valid href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md",{"range":"319","text":"317"},{"range":"320","text":"317"},{"range":"321","text":"317"},{"range":"322","text":"317"},"The href attribute is required for an anchor to be keyboard accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide an href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md",{"range":"323","text":"317"},{"range":"324","text":"317"},{"range":"325","text":"317"},{"range":"326","text":"317"},{"range":"327","text":"317"},{"range":"328","text":"317"},"'Link' is defined but never used.","'hoverImg' is assigned a value but never used.","'setHoverImg' is assigned a value but never used.","'imgPosition' is assigned a value but never used.","'showText' is assigned a value but never used.","'activeIndex' is assigned a value but never used.","'showDropdown' is assigned a value but never used.","'setShowDropdown' is assigned a value but never used.",{"range":"329","text":"317"},"'frameCount' is assigned a value but never used.","'setActivePages' is assigned a value but never used.","'frame' is assigned a value but never used.","'checkkMobile' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has an unnecessary dependency: 'window.innerWidth'. Either exclude it or remove the dependency array. Outer scope values like 'window.innerWidth' aren't valid dependencies because mutating them doesn't re-render the component.","ArrayExpression",["330"],"jsx-a11y/alt-text","img elements must have an alt prop, either with meaningful text, or an empty string for decorative images.","The 'sectionRefs' object makes the dependencies of useEffect Hook (at line 52) change on every render. Move it inside the useEffect callback. Alternatively, wrap the initialization of 'sectionRefs' in its own useMemo() Hook.","VariableDeclarator","The 'observer' object construction makes the dependencies of useEffect Hook (at line 52) change on every render. Move it inside the useEffect callback. Alternatively, wrap the initialization of 'observer' in its own useMemo() Hook.","'useLocation' is defined but never used.","'styles' is defined but never used.","'pageX' is assigned a value but never used.","'pageY' is assigned a value but never used.","'setFrameCount' is assigned a value but never used.","'newPx' is assigned a value but never used.","'newPy' is assigned a value but never used.",[4158,4158]," rel=\"noreferrer\"",[1936,1936],[4877,4877],[5222,5222],[5598,5598],[5952,5952],[2298,2298],[3674,3674],[4535,4535],[5787,5787],[6750,6750],[3514,3514],[4276,4276],{"desc":"331","fix":"332"},"Update the dependencies array to be: []",{"range":"333","text":"334"},[2147,2166],"[]"]